6335581,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCs913Q","user":{"login":"LilithSilver","id":84940819,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0OTQwODE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/84940819?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver","html_url":"https://github.com/LilithSilver","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-18T09:34:14Z","updated_at":"2026-05-18T09:34:14Z","body":"> What is the issue you are reporting? What problems is this causing?\n\nThe issue: The format is inconsistent with the rest of Godot's .tscn format. In all other cases I could find, there is no space between the property and the value in the item header.\n\nI encountered this issue while trying to write a custom Godot serializer/deserializer. I had to special-case a space after `binds=` to mimic the incorrect behavior. It's very easy to work around, but it's still a bug, IMO. (Unless this is explicitly intended behavior for a reason I'm not understanding!) ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4476335581/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.git